libh264bsd - H.264 baseline profile decoder
===========================================

Upstream : https://github.com/oneam/h264bsd
Commit   : 42bcb5d753ad86d84903354bf3c68423c28adb7b
Origin   : Android Open Source Project software H.264 decoder (On2/Hantro)
License  : Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE.md). Compatible with Rockbox's
           GPL "version 2 or later" via GPLv3.

Only src/*.c and src/*.h are imported. Local modifications are listed below.

Local changes
-------------
- Allocation goes through H264BSD_MALLOC/H264BSD_FREE (h264bsd_util.h), which
  Rockbox builds point at h264bsd_ext_malloc/free (H264BSD_EXTERNAL_ALLOC).
- <memory.h> replaced by <string.h> (not present in Rockbox's libc).
- Macros ABS/MIN/MAX and function abs() renamed H264BSD_ABS/MIN/MAX and
  h264bsd_abs() to avoid clashing with Rockbox's stdlib.h / system.h.
